WEBVTT

00:02:29.556 --> 00:02:34.196
We have disproportionately
contributed to climate change,

00:02:34.196 --> 00:02:38.996
so we must do more now
to help tackle climate change.

00:02:39.036 --> 00:02:42.196
So in recent years,
Scotland, this small country,

00:02:42.196 --> 00:02:47.756
has decarbonized faster
than any G20 country.

00:02:47.796 --> 00:02:49.396
We have just become --

00:02:49.396 --> 00:02:51.796
(Applause)

00:02:54.036 --> 00:02:58.396
We have just become
the first nation in the world

00:02:58.396 --> 00:03:01.436
that is not an independent nation --